    # "As I severed their heads off, the two corpses slumped down lifelessly against the wall, leaving behind dragging blood trails."
    "내가 그들의 머리를 잘라내자, 두 시체가 벽에 기대어 생명 없이 축 늘어졌고, 핏자국만 질질 끌렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:167
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_914bd7e2:

    # "Nijah, now terrified, kicked away her chair as she jumped away from us, ready to scream in terror."
    "이제 공포에 질린 니자는 의자를 걷어차며 우리에게서 뛰어 물러나, 비명을 지를 태세였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:168
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_9b3f7f14:

    # "I motioned desperately for her to be silent, but there was a wide-eyed terror in her eyes and I knew she might scream any moment."
    "나는 필사적으로 조용히 하라고 손짓했지만, 그녀의 눈에는 큰 공포가 가득했고 언제라도 비명을 지를 것 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:169
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_16e76f01:

    # "Markus quickly rose to his feet, and grabbed her."
    "마커스가 재빨리 일어서 그녀를 붙잡았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:170
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_d815c03a:

    # "Covering her mouth as he motioned again for her to be quiet."
    "그녀의 입을 막으며 다시 조용히 하라고 손짓했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:171
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_1b45bda4:

    # MARKUS "If you scream this place will become a bloodbath!"
    MARKUS "비명 지르면 이곳은 피바다가 될 거야!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:172
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_aa600d0f:

    # "After a few minues of restless breathing, Nijah slowly began to calm."
    "몇 분간 불안한 숨을 몰아쉬다가, 니자는 천천히 진정되기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:173
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_a7730668:

    # MARKUS "You weren't supposed to see that... But we need you to stay calm, can you do that?"
    MARKUS "그건 보지 말았어야 했는데... 하지만 침착해야 해, 할 수 있지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:174
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_bd842606:

    # "Nijah nodded anxiously as Markus slowly loosened his grip over her mouth."
    "니자는 불안하게 고개를 끄덕였고, 마커스는 천천히 그녀의 입을 막고 있던 손을 풀었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:175
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_71a25315:

    # "Tarek, now writhing in agony on the floor, desperately wheezed as he struggled to breathe."
    "타렉은 바닥에서 고통스럽게 몸부림치며 숨을 쉬려고 필사적으로 쌕쌕거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:176
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_d7439580:

    # "His eyes rolled white as his jaw locked and he began to foam at the mouth. He clawed furiously at his throat..."
    "그의 눈이 뒤집히고 턱이 굳어지며 입에 거품을 물기 시작했다. 그는 미친 듯이 자신의 목을 긁어대며..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:177
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_92d6cbf9:

    # "Tearing through his own neck, the violent convulsions stopped as two bloody trails emerged from both of his eyes and dripped down onto the floor."
    "자신의 목을 찢으며, 격렬한 경련이 멈추고 양쪽 눈에서 두 줄기 핏자국이 흘러 바닥으로 떨어졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:178
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_428a3c12:

    # "After a few more convulsions, Tarek stopped, blood gurgling out of his mouth."
    "몇 번의 경련이 더 있은 후 타렉은 멈추었고, 입에서 피가 꾸르륵 흘러나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:179
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_dfe2dc08:

    # MC @ talk "... Is he dead?"
    MC @ talk "... 죽은 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:180
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_9511ec9b:

    # "...I finally asked after a few moments of silence passed."
    "...잠시 침묵이 흐른 후 내가 마침내 물었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:181
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_4bf231fb:

    # MARKUS "He’s seen better days."
    MARKUS "좋은 시절도 있었나 보군."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:182
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_843da995:

    # NIJAH "We go, {i}now!{/i}"
    NIJAH "가자, {i}지금!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:184
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_bd7f1c1d:

    # "Both me and Markus nodded and transformed back into our human forms."
    "나와 마커스는 고개를 끄덕이고 인간 형태로 되돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:185
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_a0d78fb7:

    # "About to leave, I snatched a hefty pouch of gold from Tarek's table."
    "떠나려던 참에, 나는 타렉의 테이블에서 두둑한 금 주머니를 낚아챘다."

